u kim koydu? Sen olsan bu soruyu sorar mıydın? Yorumlara yaz.", "kesimler": [[3.421, 0.08900000000000019], [7.74, 0.0889999999999993], [14.252999999999998, 0.08900000000000108], [28.859, 0.14600000000000146], [35.047, 0.05300000000000149], [39.912, 0.40199999999999814], [43.836, 0.40199999999999814], [46.46, 0.052999999999994385], [50.244, 0.40199999999999814]]}